WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.512
This version uses row number inside each department.

00:00:03.512 --> 00:00:10.332
Salary defines the main descending order, and employee I D provides a stable tie-breaker.

00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:14.252
The outer query keeps only row numbers one and two.

00:00:14.252 --> 00:00:21.947
Because row number always assigns unique positions, the result contains at most two employees per department.

00:00:21.947 --> 00:00:27.022
Use this pattern when the requirement is exactly a fixed number of rows per group.
